{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29206","headline":"秋夜与友人宿 · 许浑","name":"秋夜与友人宿","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"楚国同游过十霜，万重心事几堪伤。\n蒹葭露白莲塘浅，砧杵夜清河汉凉。\n云外山川归梦远，天涯岐路客愁长。\n塞城欲晓闻吹笛，犹卧东轩月满牀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29206.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29206","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}